==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sword & Shield|Dubwool|154}} from the {{TCG|Sword & Shield}} expansion.
*'''Boundless Power''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Secret Wonders|Lickilicky|12}} from the {{TCG|Secret Wonders}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

